{{% /tip %}}

{{% warning %}}
Pitfall or danger.
{{% /warning %}}
```

## Module 15 — Interview Quick Reference

One-page summaries only. No coding problems. Favor dense tables and diagrams over long prose.

## Stub Generator

`scripts/generate_java_cheatsheet_stubs.py` — regenerates draft stubs from `data/java_engineering_modules.yaml`.

Skips reference pages: `primitive-data-types`, `hashmap`, `lambda`, `virtual-threads`, `collections-complexity`, `java-8-features`.

## Workflow

1. Add topic slug to `data/java_engineering_modules.yaml`
2. Add metadata to `TITLES` in `scripts/generate_java_cheatsheet_stubs.py`
3. Run `python scripts/generate_java_cheatsheet_stubs.py`
4. Fill in content; set `draft: false`
5. Preview: `hugo server -D` — restart server after new section registration

